    44	### Finding 2 (Minor / Evidence Scope): Excerpt Text Scope Alignment for Scheme Citations
    45	- **Quoted Passage 1 ([`chapters/06-certified-inspection-microfirm.html#L41`](file:///home/diablo/book19/chapters/06-certified-inspection-microfirm.html#L41)):**
    46	  > *"...the certification body reviews every branch at least annually, including a sample of files. `<!-- CHECK: 06-change-control -->`"*
    47	  - **What Cited Source Supports:**
    48	    Excerpt [`06-change-control.txt`](file:///home/diablo/book19/resources/sources/06/excerpts/06-change-control.txt) quotes Staatscourant 2026, 29952 Article 63(1) (*"in ieder certificatiejaar ten minste één beoordeling van iedere vestiging"*), but omits the explicit clause regarding file sampling / project dossier assessments (which is governed under Article 64, cited separately in `06-audit-load`).
    49	  - **Concrete Fix:**
    50	    Tighten the sentence to match the exact branch assessment rule in Article 63(1), or expand [`06-change-control.txt`](file:///home/diablo/book19/resources/sources/06/excerpts/06-change-control.txt) with the audit scope clause:
    51	    ```html
