    53	    ```
    54	- **Quoted Passage 2 ([`chapters/06-certified-inspection-microfirm.html#L49`](file:///home/diablo/book19/chapters/06-certified-inspection-microfirm.html#L49)):**
    55	  > *"The scheme requires a quality system, controlled documents, internal review, training records and long report retention. `<!-- CHECK: 06-quality-system -->`"*
    56	  - **What Cited Source Supports:**
